---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Metify and Taikun Announce Global Strategic Partnership — Metify" description="Metify and Taikun partner to deliver Taikun CloudWorks — a game-changing solution for Kubernetes management on bare metal.">
  <article class="py-24 bg-brand-darker">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <a href="/blog" class="text-brand-green text-sm font-semibold hover:underline mb-8 inline-flex items-center">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 mr-1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7" /></svg>
        Back to Blog
      </a>
      <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-white mt-4 mb-4">Metify and Taikun Announce Global Strategic Partnership</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-500 mb-8">December 10, 2024 &middot; By Mike Wagner, CEO</p>

      <div class="prose prose-lg prose-invert max-w-none">
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-8">We're thrilled to announce our global strategic partnership with Taikun, bringing you "Taikun CloudWorks" — a game-changing solution for Kubernetes management!</p>

        <blockquote class="border-l-4 border-brand-green pl-6 my-8">
          <p class="text-gray-300 italic">"The integrated solution we developed with Taikun offers several industry-first features to infrastructure teams including: Zero-Touch Provisioning (ZTP), Unified Root of Trust Security, Intelligent Server Discovery and Pooling, and Advanced Kubernetes deployment and management."</p>
          <cite class="text-brand-green font-semibold block mt-2">— Michael Wagner, CEO of Metify</cite>
        </blockquote>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-10 mb-4">What's New?</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-gray-400 mb-8">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-green mt-1 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
            Seamless integration from bare metal provisioning to app deployment
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-green mt-1 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
            Advanced K8s management meets top-tier hardware automation
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-green mt-1 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
            Multi-vendor infrastructure automation for all major server brands including Dell, HPE, Lenovo, Cisco, MiTAK, Intel, Supermicro, and more
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-green mt-1 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
            Simplified infrastructure across 9 major platforms, including AWS, Azure, Google Cloud, OpenShift, Proxmox, and more
          </li>
        </ul>

        <blockquote class="border-l-4 border-brand-green pl-6 my-8">
          <p class="text-gray-300 italic">"This collaboration marks a significant step forward in delivering simplified, comprehensive infrastructure solutions."</p>
          <cite class="text-brand-green font-semibold block mt-2">— Adam Skotnicky, CEO of Taikun</cite>
        </blockquote>

        <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-6">This partnership addresses the growing need for a secure, user-friendly platform in the Kubernetes ecosystem. Say goodbye to long lead times associated with complex hardware and software setups!</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
